# --- dev-only sources ---
.vscode/**
src/**
test/**
scripts/**
esbuild.mjs
tsconfig.json
vitest.config.mts
**/*.map
**/*.test.*
**/__tests__/**
.gitignore
MANUAL-TEST.md

# --- NATIVE MODULE STRATEGY (see package.json "//" decision) ---
# The esbuild HOST bundle keeps better-sqlite3 EXTERNAL, so its runtime files
# must ship inside the vsix. better-sqlite3 >= 13 is self-contained: the
# platform binaries live in prebuilds/*.node and lib/ is plain JS — no
# bindings/node-addon-api needed at RUNTIME (both are build/install-time only).
# Everything else in node_modules is bundled into dist/ by esbuild, so with
# `vsce package --no-dependencies` we exclude ALL of node_modules and
# whitelist exactly the sqlite runtime chain:
node_modules/**
!node_modules/better-sqlite3/lib/**
!node_modules/better-sqlite3/prebuilds/**
!node_modules/better-sqlite3/package.json
!node_modules/better-sqlite3/LICENSE
!node_modules/better-sqlite3/README.md
